 - Periods start and end at midnight UTC, and the end is the start of the day after the last day. A
   period that ends where another begins does not overlap it. Each booking is priced as whole days times
   the daily price.
+- `availability({ start, end, kind })` returns the sorted ids of the items free for the whole period, of
+  `kind` (`'board'` or `'sail'`) when given and of any kind otherwise. It reserves nothing, so the desk can
+  show what can still be rented before quoting. It throws for a period that is not allowed or an unknown kind.
 - `quote` and `book` throw for an unknown item or a period that is not allowed. `book` also throws when
